Description: Load, explore and wrangle data from relational trait databases
    built with 'traits.build' <https://github.com/traitecoevo/traits.build>,
    such as AusTraits, the Australian plant trait database (Falster et al.
    2021 <doi:10.1038/s41597-021-01006-6>). Functions load a database from
    its DOI, join data across its tables, filter it to specific taxa, traits
    or datasets, combine several databases, look up references, and
    visualise the distribution of the data.
